# Design Requirements

- Prioritize reaching and crossing this blocker over general project-wide coverage.
- Build the shortest realistic API sequence needed to make the blocked predicate satisfiable.
- You may redesign input consumption if needed, but keep the target deterministic and stateless.
- Use public APIs and real project headers only.
- Maintain strict memory safety and clean resource handling.
- Prefer a simple, explainable structure over a broad multi-API target.

